# GEARS demo: three independent simulations
# Run each one separately:
#
#   gears demo_event.mac   — event mode (6 columns)
#   gears demo_step.mac    — step mode (29 columns)
#   gears demo_score.mac   — mesh scoring (/score/ commands)
#
# Each produces its own output file.
# They cannot be combined in one session because
# /output/mode and /geometry/source require PreInit state.
